<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Semiconductor equipment still a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Semiconductor equipment still a buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said Wednesday that analyst Elliot Rogers reiterated buy ratings on three semiconductor equipment companies.</p>
<p>-- Companies include KLA-Tencor Corp, Teradyne Inc and Applied Materials Inc.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares in KLA fell 1/4 to 43, Teradyne fell one to 37-3/4 and Applied Materials fell 9/16 to 60-3/16.</p>
</text>
